diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index f185494..1f7d78f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -59,3 +59,12 @@ Settings ends with a muted red **Delete all data** button (translucent red tint,
 **Meal totals theme fix (fibre / salt / sugar icons and fields):** the three yellow fields at the top of an expanded meal were not picked up by the theme CSS (they only had `data-meal-total`), so their colours, radius, border, shadow and clip-path did not follow the selected style and their icons did not follow the theme's text colour. They now carry `data-nutrient="fiber|salt|sugar"` like the item fields and the Today cards, and their icons use the same size (15) as the per-item fields. Edited `src/components/dashboard/MealNutrientTotals.tsx` only; no new files, no `package.json` change. See [docs/journal-pages.md](docs/journal-pages.md) and [docs/file-map/components-dashboard.md](docs/file-map/components-dashboard.md).
 
 **Logo-click round (animated poop):** tapping the **Kakcal logo** at the top of the page now animates **only the poop** of the wordmark (the K and the letters stay still) and still does what it did before (back to Today, or scroll to the top). Six new animations inspired by the launch intro, none of them a copy: *plop* (falls, squashes, bounces, creases redraw), *flush* (spins down a whirlpool and corkscrews back up), *jelly* (squash and stretch wobble), *flip* (crouch, jump, front flip, squashed landing), *press* (pressed like a key, pops with three burst ticks) and *sketch* (draws itself stroke by stroke, then a happy pop). A random one is picked and never the same twice in a row; tapping during an animation restarts with another one; nothing plays with *reduce motion*. `?poop=1` to `?poop=6` forces one for review. New files `src/components/common/poopAnimations.ts` and `poop-anim.css`; edited `Brand.tsx` (marks up the poop) and `Header.tsx` (click handler). No `package.json` change. See [docs/motion.md](docs/motion.md#logo-click-poop-animations).
+
+**Meal-by-time round (the meal is chosen for you):** opening Add food from the bottom bar or a widget, and the Foods and Custom pages, now preselect the meal that fits the time of day (breakfast 05:00-09:59, morning snack 10:00-11:29, lunch 11:30-14:59, afternoon snack 15:00-17:59, dinner 18:00-22:29, extra otherwise) instead of the last used meal or a fixed *lunch*; every meal picker still lets you change it, the **+** of a meal card still opens its own meal, and a meal hidden in the advanced layout falls back to the closest visible one. New file `src/utils/mealByTime.ts`; edited `mealSlots.ts` (`useAutoMealSlot`), `QuickAddBar.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `FoodDatabaseView.tsx`, `PreBuiltMealsView.tsx`. No `package.json` change. See [docs/journal-pages.md](docs/journal-pages.md) and [docs/changes-patch.md](docs/changes-patch.md).
+
+**Koink-branding round (wordmark):** the **Kakcal wordmark now follows the Koink wordmark**: Koink's K, `kcal` in Nunito ExtraBold at Koink's size (as outlines, so no font is loaded for the logo any more and the `Nunito` `@font-face` was removed), and the **poop standing exactly where Koink's pig stands**: same left and right edge (same gaps to the K and the letters), same line weight, flat base on the K's bottom edge, tip below the K's top like the pig's head. Same view-box height as Koink's, so both are the same size at the same CSS height. Colours stay Kakcal's. The logo-click poop animations keep working (`kc-poop-group` is the new hook). `scripts/outline-wordmark.mjs` is now the generator of every wordmark SVG (computed from the pig's numbers). Edited `Brand.tsx`, `index.css`, `poop-anim.css`, `scripts/smoke.mjs`, the wordmark SVGs; new `docs/branding-render.png`. No `package.json` change. See [docs/brand.md](docs/brand.md#koink-style-wordmark) and [docs/known-gaps.md](docs/known-gaps.md) #12.
+
+**Koink-branding round 2 (colours, icon, line weight):** the brand colours are now **Koink's exactly** (ink `#0B0F1E` on `#F9F3E6`; dark `#F9F3E6` on `#070A14`); the header wordmark uses `--kc-brand-ink` (the same in every style preset) instead of the theme text colour. The **poop's line weight equals the pig's** in both places: 7.97 in the wordmark and 26.00 in the icon (icon units). The **app icon is redrawn like Koink's**: Koink's tile and K, the poop where the pig is (same width and edges, same halo), and every derived file follows: launcher, round, adaptive foreground (background `#F9F3E6`), Play Store, PWA icons, favicon, notification glyph, and the design-asset icons. New files `scripts/brand-geometry.mjs` (all the numbers, shared) and `scripts/generate-icon.mjs`; edited `generate-notification-icon.mjs`, `render-brand.mjs`, `render-pwa-icons.mjs`, `outline-wordmark.mjs`, `Brand.tsx`, `index.css`, `ic_launcher_background.xml`; `docs/branding-render.png` is now a render of the real app header. No `package.json` change. See [docs/brand.md](docs/brand.md#koink-style-icon).
+
+**Koink-branding round 3 (every place):** the six **launch animations**, the six lockups and the overview sheet are redrawn with Koink's K and the poop (new `scripts/generate-intro-animations.mjs`; their last frame is the new icon / wordmark; the overlay ink in `intro.css` is Koink's `#0B0F1E` / `#F9F3E6`). **Notifications:** the Android notification accent is now `#0B0F1E` (`capacitor.config.json`, `notifications.ts`) and browser notifications carry the app icon and a new white-glyph badge `public/icons/badge-96.png` (written by `generate-notification-icon.mjs`). **PWA:** service-worker cache `kakcalculator-shell-v4` (so installed copies refresh), `/icons/*` is `no-cache` in `public/_headers`. `scripts/smoke.mjs` now looks for the new plate colour. See [docs/brand.md](docs/brand.md#launch-animations-and-every-other-place-the-logo-appears) for the full list of places and what was left alone.
+
